  "title": "Classic Gingerbread Cutouts",
  "description": "These delicious gingerbread cut out cookies are naturally low-fat and are best topped with royal icing. These cookies are a perfect holiday treat!",
  "authors": [
    "Brandi Clark"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-10-20T16:31:10-04:00",
